{"updated":"2026-11-09T10:23:42.697Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfhCTTngIMn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhCTTngIMn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"沒想到一個像素沙盒，竟然能玩出化學實驗、黑洞，甚至超新星爆炸\n\n🔥 33 種材料，模擬火焰、水流、爆炸與植物生長\n🧪 化學實驗室，支援 78 種化學反應\n🌌 黑洞、星系、超新星與煙火粒子特效\n⚛️ 3D 元素週期表，探索 118 種元素\n🎨 ASCII 花園、數學視覺化與 3D 圖形\n👥 支援最多 9 人連線，共同創造沙盒世界\n🎮 內建 7 個挑戰關卡，還能自由創作\n\n整個專案使用 TypeScript、WebGL 與 Web Worker，模擬以固定 60Hz 運作，連圖形與音樂都是程式化生成\n#OpenSource #GitHub #TypeScript #WebGL #PixelArt","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:43:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhCZH0k92W","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhCZH0k92W","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗：\ncloverag.github.io/pixel…\n\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/Clove…\n\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:43:45.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfguGBBgCFD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfguGBBgCFD","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"沒想到一棵樹也能做得這麼精緻，甚至還能直接拿來當遊戲素材！🌳🤯\n\n🌳 內建橡樹、松樹、柳樹等 6 種植被\n🌸 支援春天、秋天、櫻花、冰霜與夜晚主題\n🍃 模擬風吹樹葉、落葉飄散與樹木生長\n🎨 自訂樹枝、葉片、光影與顏色\n🎮 匯出 GLB 模型、PNG、Sprite Sheet\n⚡ 支援 LOD 多細節層級，方便遊戲效能最佳化\n\n最酷的是，整棵樹都是由程式生成，連葉片貼圖也不例外，不需要事先建模！\n\n而且直接開瀏覽器就能玩，調整完還能匯出素材，拿來做獨立遊戲或 3D 場景真的超適合！🔥\n\n#ThreeJS #WebGPU #OpenSource #GameDev #ProceduralGeneration","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:47:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfguRxsExDn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfguRxsExDn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗：\njustasimpletree.com\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/MikeF…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:47:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfgq2zVE5J-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfgq2zVE5J-","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"沒想到 Godot 不只能做遊戲，還能拿來打造一整座智慧工廠\n分享一個超酷的開源專案：Open Industry Project，把工業自動化、3D 模擬與 PLC 控制整合在一起\n自由組裝輸送帶、感測器等工廠設備\n建立 3D 產線，模擬設備運作\n支援 OPC UA、Modbus TCP、EtherNet/IP\n可串接 Siemens、Beckhoff PLC 與工業機器人\n透過即時資料連動虛擬設備\n🎮 基於 Godot，還能匯入自己的 3D 模型\n最吸引我的是，它不只是做出漂亮的工廠動畫，而是真的能跟工業控制系統通訊！\n拿來研究智慧工廠、數位孿生（Digital Twin）或產線模擬，感覺超有潛力！\n#Godot #OpenSource #SmartFactory #DigitalTwin #PLC","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:18:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfgq2vJE_xu","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfgq2vJE_xu","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"專案連結：\ngithub.com/Open…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:18:05.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfeK7uskxg6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfeK7uskxg6","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"讓 AI Agent 變成像素小員工，在辦公室裡幫你寫程式！🤣\n\n它能把 Claude Code 的工作狀態變成可愛的像素角色，直接在 VS Code 或瀏覽器裡打造一間 AI 辦公室！\n\n👨‍💻 每個 AI Agent 都有自己的角色與座位\n⌨️ 寫程式、讀檔案、執行指令都有對應動畫\n💬 AI 卡住或需要授權時，角色會跳出提示\n🏢 自由布置辦公室、家具、地板，還能養寵物\n🤖 支援顯示 Sub-agents 與 Agent Teams\n🌐 提供 VS Code 擴充套件與獨立 CLI 版本\n\n最有趣的是，當你同時開好幾個 Claude Code Agent，就像在經營一間迷你軟體公司，看著員工們各自忙碌！😂\n\n以後寫程式根本是在玩像素風經營遊戲！\n#ClaudeCode #AIAgent #OpenSource #VSCode #PixelArt","timestamp":"2026-11-08T07:00:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfeK7r1E-We","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfeK7r1E-We","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/pixel…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-08T07:00:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcSA5DE5Js","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfcSA5DE5Js","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做 2D 遊戲最崩潰的，不是寫程式，而是角色動畫要一幀一幀畫\n\n只要提供角色描述，就能透過 AI Agent 產生遊戲用的角色素材與動畫。\n\n🎨 AI 生成角色，維持不同動作的外觀一致性\n🏃 自動製作待機、走路、跑步、攻擊等動畫\n🪄 將影片轉成透明背景的 Sprite Sheet、PNG、GIF\n🗺️ 支援生成 2D 地圖與像素風格素材\n🎮 可匯出 Godot、Aseprite 與網頁遊戲素材\n🤖 支援 Claude Code、Codex、Grok\n\n#AI #GameDev #PixelArt #OpenSource #ClaudeCode","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfcSA6AE83B","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfcSA6AE83B","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/0x0fu…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfYj5X-k7zX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfYj5X-k7zX","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"持股已經綠到有牛在上面吃草了","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:43:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfYj5VgEyWr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfYj5VgEyWr","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"malilion.github.io/cow-p…","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:43:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfhEUqUCiIT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhEUqUCiIT","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"2026年接近尾聲 \n大家不知道對自己現有的工作還有任何情感嗎？ \n原PO好奇已經準備好明年要離職的人 \n現在都是什麼心態在工作？","timestamp":"2026-11-09T10:00:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhEWgIiqTV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhEWgIiqTV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨#閒聊 多少人預計明年要離職了✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多工作的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-09T10:00:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhA1ktDe-x","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhA1ktDe-x","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"「 我喜歡你 」這句話，太輕浮。\n\n「 我愛你 」這句話，太沈重。\n\n「 11/28一起去投票 」這句話，剛剛好。","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:30:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":26,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":33,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhA2TIDT1o","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhA2TIDT1o","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家都買好高鐵票了嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:30:16.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhA3JfDZx4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhA3JfDZx4","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"挺誰是本能，說清楚是本事😎 \n年輕人都在這裡等你破圈\n馬上到 Dcard 為你支持的候選人發聲 👉 dcard.link/zbgDq…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:30:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe7Bw6iHMq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe7Bw6iHMq","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"00年卡通回憶殺✨你看過幾部？👀\n1️⃣ 真珠美人魚\n2️⃣ 飛天小女警\n3️⃣ 小魔女doremi\n4️⃣ 魔女的考驗\n5️⃣ 膽小狗英雄\n6️⃣ 大嘴鳥\n7️⃣ 校園嬌娃\n\n你最喜歡的一部是？🙌","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:00:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":38,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":40,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe7D6xiP-G","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe7D6xiP-G","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"還有哪些卡通是你的童年回憶呢？🥹\n原文來自✨00年卡通回憶殺✨你看過幾部？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多女孩的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:01:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe0HjADVZ7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe0HjADVZ7","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家嚮往海綿寶寶的生活嗎？🥹\n原文來自✨海綿寶寶是不是很幸福的人？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多心情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-08T13:00:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfe0GWfjUj3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe0GWfjUj3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"海綿寶寶是不是很幸福的人？\n一位卡友分享：以前小時候看海綿寶寶，就很羨慕他的生活\n能有一棟屬於自己的超大房子，加上過去對烹飪很有興趣\n所以看到海綿寶寶是速食店的廚師\n一個人熟練地煎著蟹堡\n就很希望未來能當個快樂的廚師，做著喜歡的工作。\n\n但隨著年紀增長，發現海綿寶寶的生活不只令人嚮往\n更重要的是，我覺得他是個非常知足的人。\n\n他能有一顆正向樂觀的心，與最好的朋友派大星\n享受著快樂自在的生活，不用為了生活而煩惱。\n永遠保有一顆正向的心。\n\n大家覺得卡友說得中肯嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-08T13:00:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":57,"replies":1,"reposts":2,"shares":10},"score":65,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfetWECj5qg","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfetWECj5qg","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B8卡友分享：去年出去玩拍到的🐢","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:01:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfetUz6j-gj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfetUz6j-gj","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B20卡友分享：花瓶岩和花瓶雲 (˵˚ ω ˚˵)","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:01:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","late