tamp":"2026-11-08T13:18:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":15,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":15,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfexJlxlNTr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfexJlxlNTr","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:34:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfexJJ1FFKt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfexJJ1FFKt","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"畫人物不必只靠文字描述！Open Pose & Costume 可依姿勢、服裝與人物篩選參考，部分動作還有多視角與深度圖。程式碼開源不代表圖片可任意商用，自建素材及衍生圖限非商用。怎麼挑圖、組合與確認授權？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:34:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Line 群組裡面有個 Grok Bot 真的超方便\n\nBot 可以做到：\n- 詢問大家方便聚餐的時間\n- 找餐廳給大家選\n- 選好餐廳後直接打開 inline 或 Open Table 網頁訂位\n- 訂完位之後就順便建立行事曆\n- 把行事曆連結丟回到群組\n\n以前還要有個人當主揪\n現在直接把主揪丟給 AI 來當就好","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":269,"replies":31,"reposts":22,"shares":193},"score":397,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe_a1BH9tN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfe_a1BH9tN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"圖文版上架囉！","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:39:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZlZDn0RU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZlZDn0RU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"陪客戶做夢(O)\n陪客戶做自動化(X)\n\n最近對於 AI 模型的進步突然有感而發\n五個月前，同一個客戶需求\n用當時的 opus 只能跑出 6x% 的成功率\n\n而現在只需要 sonnet 5.5 \n就能跑出 99% 以上的成功率\n\n這個場景是客戶流程的一大痛點\n他們會收到一份超多頁的 pdf\n以往都需要人工逐頁處理跟登打\n\n現在因為他們導入了新的 ERP 系統\n系統本身也能很簡單的就跟 AI 做串接\n又享受到 AI 模型的進步\n\n只需要在系統裡面做一部：上傳\n接著就放手交給 AI + 系統處理\n一個 PDF → 一百多筆資料 → 全自動出現在系統\n同仁只需要確認那些 AI 回報信心程度較低的項目就好\n\n一個小時的工作只剩下不到幾分鐘！\n如果你想知道這是哪套 ERP 系統 ↓","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZl3NHyAF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZl3NHyAF","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"歡迎洽詢 Odoo ERP \n找 @lupus_rr 評估自己的公司是否適合換成 Odoo\n\n享受簡單易用、又能根據需求客製化的 ERP 系統","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfeH9LAG9Cx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfeH9LAG9Cx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"iPhone手機複製，Mac 直接貼上。\n中間不用傳給Line了！！\n​\n這個功能叫「通用剪貼板」，\n跟 AirDrop 一樣是蘋果內建的互通功能，\n文字、圖片都能直接過去。\n​\n◼︎ 設定兩步\n① iPhone：設定 → 一般 → AirPlay 與接續互動 → 打開 Handoff\n② Mac：系統設定 → 一般 → AirDrop 與接續互動 → 打開接續互動\n​\n◼︎ 記得\n✅ 兩台登入同一個 Apple ID\n✅ 藍牙、Wi-Fi 都要開","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:34:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":108,"replies":15,"reposts":13,"shares":230},"score":177,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfgiXgflA-H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfgiXgflA-H","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"但如果需要多則常用訊息存成快捷！可以使用CopyNow的快捷卡片+鍵盤⌨️\n更方便管理！\napps.apple.com/us/ap…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:03:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T18:24:32+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}